---
import BaseLayout from '../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Practice — Alexis 智立"
  description="Practice around co-living, commons, and alternative spaces."
  mycelium="subtle"
>
  <article class="container reading">
    <header class="about-sub-header">
      <h1><span lang="zh">实践</span> · Practice</h1>
      <p class="about-sub-intro" lang="zh">探索共居、公地与替代性空间的实验，以及这些实践如何在更广泛的生态中成长。</p>
      <p class="about-sub-intro" lang="en">
        Experiments in co-living, commons, and alternative spaces — and how
        they grow as part of a wider ecology.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2><span lang="zh">共居与公地</span> · Co-living and commons</h2>
      <p lang="zh">这里关注共居与公地的具体实践：社区如何组织，日常生活如何安排，以及其中有哪些互助与摩擦。</p>
      <p lang="en">
        This section focuses on co-living and commons in practice:
        how specific communities are organized, how daily life is arranged, and
        what kinds of support and friction appear.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2><span lang="zh">替代性空间</span> · Alternative spaces</h2>
      <p lang="zh">这里关注 Dweller、普罗托邦等替代性空间如何形成，以及它们之间如何建立联系。</p>
      <p lang="en">This section looks at how alternative spaces such as Dweller and Protopia take shape and relate to one another.</p>
    </section>

    <p class="back-link">
      <a href="/about">← <span lang="zh">返回关于页面</span> · Back to About</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-sub-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .about-sub-intro {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .back-link {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .back-link a {
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }
  .back-link a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
</style>

